Here's a status-filterable list of eight items. A segmented control at the top holds the status filter, and a sortable table below shows each item's title, status, and one-line detail. You can also sort by the Status column to group items.

One limitation: this catalog has no actions or functions, so the filter can't hide rows on its own. Making it work needs either renderer support that connects the `status_filter` control to the table, or a follow-up update that sends a filtered set of rows.

